isco de Lima e Silva</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Francisco de Lima e Silva was a Brazilian general and politician.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/francisco-de-miranda"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/francisco-de-miranda.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Francisco de Miranda</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Francisco de Miranda was a Venezuelan revolutionary who served in the American and French revolutionary wars.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/francisco-de-montejo"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/francisco-de-montejo.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Francisco de Montejo</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Francisco de Montejo was a Spanish conquistador who served under Hernán Cortés and in 1526 received a royal contract to conquer Yucatán.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/francisco-de-montejo-the-nephew"><span class="enc-name">Francisco de Montejo the Nephew</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Francisco de Montejo the Nephew was a Spanish conquistador, nephew of the adelantado Francisco de Montejo, who took part in the final conquest of Yucatán in the 1540s.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/francisco-de-montejo-the-younger"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/francisco-de-montejo-the-younger.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Francisco de Montejo the Younger</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Francisco de Montejo the Younger was a Spanish conquistador, son of the adelantado Francisco de Montejo.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/francisco-de-orellana"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/